  "description": "<h3 data-path-to-node=\"2\"><b data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Handcrafted Spun Bamboo Fruit Bowl: Sustainable Elegance for Modern Living</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">As consumers worldwide seek eco-conscious, stylish, and functional home decor, sustainable kitchenware continues to top demand across global markets. We are proud to present our <b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"178\">Handcrafted Spun Bamboo Fruit Bowl</b>, a versatile center-piece designed to combine natural beauty, minimalism, and artisanal craftsmanship.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Product Features &amp; Selling Points</b></h3>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. 100% Eco-Friendly, Organic &amp; Natural</b></h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">Crafted from 100% natural, rapidly renewable bamboo, this fruit bowl is a safe, sustainable alternative to plastic, metal, or synthetic home decor. Free from toxic chemicals and heavy metals, it offers health-conscious consumers peace of mind while bringing an earthy, organic aesthetic to any living space.</p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Traditional Spun Bamboo Craftsmanship</b></h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Each bowl is meticulously hand-coiled and shaped by skilled Vietnamese artisans using time-tested <b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"98\">spun bamboo techniques</b>. The interior highlights the natural, warm bamboo grain, while the exterior features a smooth, durable lacquered coating (shown in a elegant soft cream/beige tone), creating a striking dual-tone contrast.</p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Multi-Functional &amp; Stylish Design</b></h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">With its shallow, wide-opening silhouette, this bowl is perfectly proportioned for various uses:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"12\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Fruit Bowl &amp; Centerpiece:</b> Keeps fresh fruits well-ventilated while serving as a stunning focal point on dining tables, kitchen islands, or coffee tables.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Decorative Storage Tray:</b> Ideal for holding keys, mail, potpourri, or everyday accessories in entryways and living rooms.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Serving Bowl:</b> Suitable for dry foods, snacks, bread, or decorative decorative displays.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sustainable Impact: Empowering Communities &amp; Preserving Heritage</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">Partnering with us allows your brand to support sustainable economic growth and cultural preservation:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Job Creation for Rural Farmers &amp; Artisans:</b> Every order directly provides stable livelihoods and fair wages to bamboo farmers and skilled village artisans in rural Vietnam.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Preserving Traditional Craft Villages:</b> Vietnam has a rich history of hand-spinning bamboo and lacquering. By exporting these handcrafted goods, we help sustain traditional craft villages and pass these unique skills to future generations.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"18\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">OEM / ODM &amp; Custom Manufacturing Solutions</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\">To help you serve your target market effectively, we offer fully customizable OEM/ODM services:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"20\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Colors &amp; Finishes:</b> Available in a wide spectrum of exterior colors (neutral tones, pastels, matte, or high-gloss lacquers) to align with your seasonal collections or brand identity.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Dimensions:</b> Sizes can be adjusted according to your technical specifications.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Private Labeling &amp; Packaging:</b> We provide custom logo laser-engraving, barcode labelling, eco-friendly retail packaging, and drop-test packaging suitable for e-commerce fulfillment (Amazon, Etsy, mail order).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"22\"><b data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Partner with Us</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23\">We invite importers, wholesalers, retail buyers, and home decor brand owners to join us in promoting sustainable, beautifully crafted bamboo products.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"24\">📩 <b data-path-to-node=\"24\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Contact Us Today</b> to request product catalogs, sample units, or competitive FOB wholesale quotations!</p>",
